# ─── AI reasoning critique ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Powers the "Pressure-test the reasoning" panel on each decision (an Opus/Sonnet
# pass that reads a decision and pushes back on it). The key is read server-side
# only (in app/api/critique/route.ts) and never reaches the browser.
#
# Get a key: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Then copy this file to .env.local, paste your key, and restart `npm run dev`.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ─── Durable store backend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave everything unset for local use → a real SQLite DB at .data/decisionos.sqlite.
#
# For cloud / multi-device (Vercel, etc.), set DATABASE_URL to a managed Postgres
# connection string — the app auto-switches to Postgres and creates its table on
# first write. See DEPLOY.md.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host/db?sslmode=require
#
# Force the dependency-free JSON-file backend instead of SQLite:
# DECISIONOS_STORE=json
